\title{icesdataqa: Data Quality Checks for ICES Stock Assessment Graphs Data}
\description{
A small framework of structural, statistical and timeliness checks for the data served by the ICES Stock Assessment Graphs (SAG) web services. Every check returns a standardised result row, and checks are run stock by stock so that stocks which do not report a variable are not mistaken for gaps. The repository also holds a 'targets' pipeline and a 'Quarto' report built on these functions. Independent project, not an official ICES product.
